{"reference":"Psalms 9","book":"Psalms","chapter":9,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"Psalm Numbering","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Some Greek and Latin Psalter traditions join Psalms 9 and 10 as one psalm, so their numbering differs from the Masoretic tradition. This can explain why references to this psalm may use a different number in those traditions.","verse_refs":["Psalms 10:1-18"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_psalms_009_f6b9c9c9a66b7295269eb18b"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}